# Purpose
Explains the GreatVibe status bar as a compact place for workspace and turn
state.

# Key Sections
- What the status bar is.
- Common signals.
- What to check when something looks wrong.
- Prompt examples.

# Dependencies
- `manage-turns-with-gv-menu-eventlog-gvturns.md`
- `../concepts/what-is-a-node.md`
- `../concepts/what-is-a-gvturn.md`

# Gotchas
- The visible status bar can change by surface and release; keep labels generic
  and tell users to rely on current UI text.

